    "Multiline discovery now rejects necessary first-byte/code failures before scanning the first-owner catalogue. The original span resolver, declaration order, weak text, placeholders and ownership/alias rules are unchanged. No whitespace pre-scan, ownership union, semantic cache or permanent alternate engine."
